\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Dec 2016."}},{"id":"quiet-moments-2016-12-07-e5","era":null,"summary":"Liliana says there is just one person she wants to kill on this plane and tells Gideon Tezzeret destroyed something that was hers.","participants":["liliana-vess","gideon-jura","tezzeret"],"location":"yahenni-s-penthouse","importance":"major","page":"stories/quiet-moments-2016-12-07","order":589,"story_date":"2016-12-07","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":90,"quote":"\"He hurt something important to me. Destroyed something that was mine.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/quiet-moments-2016-12-07#:~:text=%22He%20hurt%20something%20important,something%20that%20was%20mine.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Quiet Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-12-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/quiet-moments-2016-12-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/quiet-moments-2016-12-07#:~:text=%22He%20hurt%20something%20important,something%20that%20was%20mine.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Quiet Moments\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Dec 2016."}},{"id":"renewal-2017-02-01-e6","era":null,"summary":"At Yahenni's penthouse the Gatewatch gather before the party; Gideon forces himself to smile.","participants":["gideon-jura","nissa-revane","jace-beleren","liliana-vess","ajani-goldmane","chandra-nalaar"],"location":"yahenni-s-penthouse","importance":"minor","page":"stories/renewal-2017-02-01","order":596,"story_date":"2017-02-01","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":79,"quote":"Nonetheless, even here where no one but his friends could see him, Gideon smiled.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=Nonetheless%2C%20even%20here%20where,see%20him%2C%20Gideon%20smiled.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Renewal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Magic Creative Team"],"date":"2017-02-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=Nonetheless%2C%20even%20here%20where,see%20him%2C%20Gideon%20smiled.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Renewal\" by Magic Creative Team. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Feb 2017."}},{"id":"renewal-2017-02-01-e7","era":null,"summary":"Gideon invites Ajani to join the Gatewatch, and Ajani speaks the oath.","participants":["gideon-jura","ajani-goldmane","jace-beleren","gatewatch"],"location":"yahenni-s-penthouse","importance":"major","page":"stories/renewal-2017-02-01","order":596,"story_date":"2017-02-01","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":121,"quote":"\"Never again,\" said Ajani. \"Until all have found their place, I will keep watch.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=%22Never%20again%2C%22%20said%20Ajani.,I%20will%20keep%20watch.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Renewal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Magic Creative Team"],"date":"2017-02-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=%22Never%20again%2C%22%20said%20Ajani.,I%20will%20keep%20watch.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Renewal\" by Magic Creative Team. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Feb 2017."}},{"id":"renewal-2017-02-01-e8","era":null,"summary":"Liliana's briefing on Tezzeret and Amonkhet leads the Gatewatch to discuss stopping Bolas, whom Liliana says controls and may have created Amonkhet.","participants":["liliana-vess","gideon-jura","jace-beleren","nicol-bolas","nissa-revane"],"location":"yahenni-s-penthouse","importance":"major","page":"stories/renewal-2017-02-01","order":596,"story_date":"2017-02-01","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":133,"quote":"\"Bolas controls the place completely. As far as I know, he created it.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=%22Bolas%20controls%20the%20place,know%2C%20he%20created%20it.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Renewal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Magic Creative Team"],"date":"2017-02-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=%22Bolas%20controls%20the%20place,know%2C%20he%20created%20it.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Renewal\" by Magic Creative Team. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Feb 2017."}},{"id":"renewal-2017-02-01-e9","era":null,"summary":"Ajani reveals he once defeated Bolas in the Maelstrom, warns against going to Amonkhet and asks them to gather allies first.","participants":["ajani-goldmane","nicol-bolas","gideon-jura"],"location":"yahenni-s-penthouse","importance":"major","page":"stories/renewal-2017-02-01","order":596,"story_date":"2017-02-01","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":147,"quote":"\"Give me time to get some of those friends together.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=%22Give%20me%20time%20to,of%20those%20friends%20together.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Renewal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Magic Creative Team"],"date":"2017-02-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=%22Give%20me%20time%20to,of%20those%20friends%20together.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Renewal\" by Magic Creative Team. Magic Story, Wiza