-02-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=And%20I%20am%20not%20a%20killer.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Renewal\" by Magic Creative Team. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Feb 2017."}},{"id":"renewal-2017-02-01-e12","era":null,"summary":"At the party, Yahenni announces their will, leaving half their savings to their aetherborn family and the rest to inventor Sana Ahir.","participants":["yahenni","sana","depala","oviya-pashiri"],"location":"yahenni-s-penthouse","importance":"major","page":"stories/renewal-2017-02-01","order":596,"story_date":"2017-02-01","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":212,"quote":"\"My other half of savings goes to you, red-scarf-wearing human inventor in the corner!\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=%22My%20other%20half%20of,inventor%20in%20the%20corner%21%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Renewal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Magic Creative Team"],"date":"2017-02-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#:~:text=%22My%20other%20half%20of,inventor%20in%20the%20corner%21%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Renewal\" by Magic Creative Team. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Feb 2017."}},{"id":"renewal-2017-02-01-e13","era":null,"summary":"Nissa channels land energy to ease Yahenni's pain and tells them that aetherborn are the substance connecting the Multiverse and that she is from Zendikar.","participants":["nissa-revane","yahenni"],"location":"yahenni-s-penthouse","importance":"major","page":"stories/renewal-2017-02-01","order":596,"story_date":"2017-02-01","storyline":"Kaladesh","source":"wizards","paragraph":280,"quote":"You are what connects the Multiverse.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/renewal-2017-02-01#